ddress></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>DAIICHI PHARMACEUTICAL CO., LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FUJIWARA, KAZUKO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HARA, TSUYOSHI</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>FUJIWARA KAZUKO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>HARA TSUYOSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FUJIWARA, KAZUKO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HARA, TSUYOSHI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>Preventives/remedies for syndrome caused by the worsening of sepsis, hyperchemokinemia and hepatic diseases which contain as the active ingredient an antithrombin agent and/or a thrombin synthesis inhibitor. Because of being usable in preventing or treating diseases including sepsis, severe sepsis, septic shock and multiorgan failure, these drugs are useful in the treatment of trauma, burn, heat attack, severe infection, etc. caused by, in particular, traffic accidents in the field of emergency care. These drugs are also useful in preventing and treating hyperchemokinemia and hepatic diseases.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne des médicaments préventifs/et des remèdes contre la défaillance de plusieurs organes provoquée par l'aggravation de la septicémie, de l'hyperchémokinémie et des maladies hépatiques, contenant un agent antithrombine et/ou un inhibiteur de synthèse de la thrombine utilisé comme agent actif. Du fait qu'on peut les utiliser dans la prévention ou le traitement de maladies telles que la septicémie, la septicémie sévère, un choc septique et la défaillance de plusieurs organes, ces médicaments sont utiles pour traiter un traumatisme, une brûlure, un malaise dû à la chaleur, une infection sévère, etc., provoqués en particulier par les accidents de la route, en cas de soins d'urgence. Ces médicaments sont également utiles pour prévenir et traiter l'hyperchémokinémie et les maladies hépatiques.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>